  "source_notes": [
    "Official card captured 2026-10-19T19:38:12Z. 6 of 14 listed matchups scored.",
    "Research result history is complete only through 2026-09-19; later events are not included.",
    "Earliest card start: 2026-10-24T14:00:00Z; main card: 2026-10-24T18:00:00Z.",
    "Current card and identity links were checked by software; human roster and identity review remains pending.",
    "No bookmaker API was queried. Quoted odds on public event pages were excluded because they have no verified bookmaker capture/update times.",
    "Historical archive supplies 6,595 exactly matched paired-stat bouts. Both-fighter reach and earlier-stat coverage in the benchmark: 525/1,447 (36.3%). Missing historical evidence remains neutral; the 12 scored current fighters all have reach and earlier-fight statistics.",
    "Current official UFC profile rates are shown for context and never replace earlier-fight model inputs. Official numeric reach is interpreted as inches and converted by 2.54; archived values differ by up to 1.27 cm for five fighters. Dated official reach supplies the current V5 forecasts.",
    "Takedown accuracy is omitted because official profile panels contain inconsistent or incomplete counts for several fighters. Other published current rates are displayed as source-reported context."
