  "limitations": [
    "These are forecasts for an unstarted event using retrospectively assembled research history; they do not establish operating readiness or a wagering edge.",
    "8 matchups are not scored because stable research identities are unresolved. Provisional identities were not silently merged.",
    "Reach and earlier-fight paired strike counts enter V5. Archive reach is treated as an approximate static adult attribute in historical replay; historical measurement dates are unknown. Current career averages are descriptive only. Injuries, camps, non-UFC records and later results are not modeled.",
    "Probabilities describe model estimates, not certainty. A 60% favorite can lose four times in ten even under perfect calibration. The latest yearly benchmark is weaker than the full-history result.",
    "The card can change before fight night. This frozen edition does not update automatically."
